{
  "key": 18239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Kanto’s Power Plant?\r",
        "It’s near the end of Route 9, the road\n",
        "that heads east from here.\r",
        "I think there was an accident of\n",
        "some sort there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re collecting every single kind\n",
        "of Pokémon?\r",
        "That must be quite a challenge, but\n",
        "it sounds fun, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The cape in the north is a good\n",
        "place for dates.\r",
        "Girls like it!\r",
        "Just between you and me...\n",
        "Misty, the Gym Leader, is sometimes\f",
        "there at the cape.\r",
        "Guess I don’t stand a chance!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00003",
      "en_US": "SLOWBRO: Yarah?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00004",
      "en_US": "SLOWBRO is full of the fighting spirit!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "My SLOWBRO and I make an\n",
        "awesome combination!\r",
        "SLOWBRO, show me your Psychic!\r",
        "...!\n",
        "SLOWBRO’s Psychic hits hard!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "This shady character asked me just now\n",
        "how to get to the Power Plant.\r",
        "He said it must be kept\n",
        "“...confidential.”\r",
        "What does that mean?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "A shady character sneaked into\n",
        "the Gym! What business does\f",
        "he have with Misty?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I saw this shady guy in black go\n",
        "off toward the Cape."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00009",
      "en_US": "I’m a huge fan of Cerulean Gym’s Misty."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard of a cave here that had\n",
        "horribly powerful Pokémon in it.\f",
        "That’s why I came here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Ayuh?\r",
        "My Dowsing Machine is responding..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "This is...\n",
        "The notorious Cerulean Cave!\r",
        "Horribly powerful Pokémon live here.\n",
        "Only those who have defeated all eight\f",
        "Kanto Gym Leaders are allowed to\f",
        "challenge it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean City\n",
        "The Floral Lagoon City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Misty\f",
        "The Tomboyish Mermaid"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Trendsetter of the Bicycle Boom\r",
        "Cerulean Bike Main Shop"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a notice here...\r",
        "Stamp out thievery and make the city\n",
        "a friendlier, more cheerful place!\f",
        "Cerulean Police"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 24 Ahead\n",
        "East to Cerulean Cape"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_00018",
      "en_US": "It’s locked..."
    }
  ]
}
